s":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"7AeznT9XMDVRo6iAv7yB5g","review_id":"djzKEfWmYO7qMMl71nl7vQ","date":"2016-07-18T18:10:22","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9307993650436401,"text_excerpt":"Grits is a great neighborhood dive bar! The drinks are cheap, the staff is nice, and if you go at off times it isn't too busy. I like Grits as a bar to go with a few friends and hang out, drink a few beers, and play pool. While on weekend nights it gets a lot of the spillover from F&Ms (college kids), the crowd is usually a little older here. On weekends it turns into more of a dance party, so stay away unless that is your scene! Grits is also the bar for WAKA kickball leagues so keep that in mind if you are going during the week! Drinks -- 3.5 stars Price -- 4.5 stars Service -- 4.5 stars Atmosphere -- 3.5 stars"},{"business_id":"7AeznT9XMDVRo6iAv7yB5g","review_id":"lv1jikT8ltedHUywvCFbrQ","date":"2015-07-29T00:20:24","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9222986102104187,"text_excerpt":"Great dive bar. Bartenders are super friendly. Drinks are decently priced. Go early before the college kids roll in and it turns into Club Gritz...unless you want to dance, then stick around for the dance party."},{"business_id":"7AeznT9XMDVRo6iAv7yB5g","review_id":"iWXkh23bPRlETlckCHLRdQ","date":"2019-05-08T01:09:12","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9085690379142761,"text_excerpt":"Cute local bar but a bit dirty. Either way great hospitality and good company. A lot of tvs!! Wall decor is crazy cool to look at. Truly feels like you're in Louisiana. Cheap drinks. I went at 6pm on a Tuesday. It wasn't crowded. All ages of people were in there as well. Definitely larger than I thought the place would be. Bartender was nice and made great drinks. Will return!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"7AeznT9XMDVRo6iAv7yB5g","photo_id":"S0v-JgouR4qlyHnh7sA6-A","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/S0v-JgouR4qlyHnh7sA6-A.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.927129864692688},{"business_id":"7AeznT9XMDVRo6iAv7yB5g","photo_id":"z3TJPLjV4tmcwtnjWknImA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/z3TJPLjV4tmcwtnjWknImA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9221180081367493},{"business_id":"7AeznT9XMDVRo6iAv7yB5g","photo_id":"TbZrv02IM8qmr_F12coX9Q","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/TbZrv02IM8qmr_F12coX9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8731090426445007}]},"notebook_case":null}
